<h1>Privacy policy</h1>
<p>This policy explains what data <%= site.name %> processes and why (in line with Turkish KVKK and the GDPR principles).</p>
<h2>Data we collect</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Account:</b> username, email address and a one-way hash of your password (never stored in plain text).</li>
<li><b>Payout details:</b> the PayPal, Papara or IBAN details you enter to receive earnings. Only admins can see them.</li>
<li><b>Statistics:</b> to count views and downloads your IP address and browser are hashed one-way. Raw IP addresses are not stored in statistics tables.</li>
<li><b>Cookies:</b> one essential session cookie and your language preference. The ad network (e.g. Google AdSense) may set its own cookies under its own privacy policy.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Purposes</h2>
<p>Running your account, publishing content, preventing abuse, producing statistics, paying creator earnings and complying with the law.</p>
<h2>Sharing</h2>
<p>Your data is never sold. It is only shared with hosting, advertising and payment providers as far as the service requires, and with authorities when legally required.</p>
<h2>Your rights</h2>
<p>You can request access to, correction or deletion of your data, or object to processing: <a href="mailto:<%= site.contact %>"><%= site.contact %></a>.</p>
